{
  "about": "A config written before preset bindings: every core widget type on the bar, popup modes click, hover and none, presets with the widgets' own keys only. effects: what each bar entry did, before bindings, on each step tests/WidgetActionsTest.qml drives through real input events (a step left out did nothing); a string: the cell takes no input, its own targets keep theirs. popup steps record what the popup was asked, own actions what their target was asked (sound starts at volume 0.5, unmuted).",
